cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus, please cite it as below."
title: "Historical Shanghan Corpus"
abstract: >-
  A structured and provenance-aware corpus of the Shanghan Lun and its historical
  commentarial tradition. Release 1.0 covers 57 catalogued historical works
  (425 source text files, 4,763,991 characters) and links 398 canonical clauses
  and 283 auxiliary clauses to 2,958 aligned historical commentaries, 616
  textual variants and 4,286 inter-textual relations. Every structured record
  resolves to a catalogued work, a source text file and a verified SHA-256
  checksum. Manual review of the structured records is in progress in this
  version and no agreement statistics are reported.
type: dataset
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-11"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://psknlr.github.io/Tao-Shanghan-Corpus/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/psknlr/Tao-Shanghan-Corpus"
keywords:
  - Shanghan Lun
  - 傷寒論
  - digital humanities
  - historical corpus
  - textual criticism
  - textual variants
  - commentarial tradition
  - Literary Chinese
  - provenance
